`fpv_video0.bin` accepts an Annex-B H.264 elementary stream from a file or
stdin.  This is compatible with the OpenHD X21/RV1126(B) MPP encoder output
after RTP depacketization:

    fpv_video0.bin stream.h264
    cat stream.h264 | fpv_video0.bin -

The old X20 recovery-header probe is opt-in with `--x20`; normal X21/RV1126(B)
streams should be run without it. `--eof` is available for sources that need
explicit OMX end-of-frame flags.
